  "description": "Bring familiar LINQ queries to CSV and XLSX files. Work with typed C# objects, stream results, create or extend CSV files, and export CSV to writable streams. Select date formats, boolean/null tokens, or your own converters. .NET 10+, Native AOT, and no extra runtime package dependencies.",
