  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Prerelease: Export complete CSV documents to writable streams with CsvWriter and Write/WriteAsync. Use caller-owned streams or repeatable stream factories, including non-seekable and compression streams. Includes cancellation, configurable encoding and dialect, generated annotations, LINQ queries, and CSV file creation, append, and insertion. Native AOT and a BCL-only runtime. API changes remain possible.",
